  "title": "Answer: entities and identity emerge, and so do laws",
  "statements": [
    {
      "id": "d985ad15-2f94-4006-9c8c-ae926eea6cca",
      "text": "Entities and their identity emerge whenever constitutive activity satisfies the three projections at once. Physical laws are also derived: they are the observer's compression of what objects do from inside.",
